# Plain arithmetic — no corner of the spec is involved, which is what makes a
# failure here so serious. All four are stored immediately after being computed.
# ADD1/INC1/SHR1 go out through the EAX-only `a3` (MOV moffs32, EAX) encoding.
ADD1  0x3801
INC1  0x1
SHR1  0x7
# EDX1 is the CONTROL: identical arithmetic, stored via the ordinary `89 /r`
# form. If ADD1 is wrong while EDX1 is right, the fault is in the store
# encoding's handling, not in the ALU.
EDX1  0x3801
